     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline\">Dear Ms. Sekiya,</span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Thank you so much for responding to my query. I have two main interests in contacting you.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">My primary motivation is to help support R user groups in Japan. As the administrator of the R Consortium&#39;s <a href=\"https://www.r-consortium.org/projects/r-user-group-support-program\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-consortium.org/projects/r-user-group-support-program&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241660504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2h-wkxYDe7FtxU_JMXnzyV\">R User Group Support Program</a>, I would like to encourage existing R user groups to apply for support if the organizers think that the small financial grants we can offer, and association with our <a href=\"https://www.meetup.com/pro/r-user-groups/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.meetup.com/pro/r-user-groups/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241660504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aBr47BkjnjwXZJhkvNnlO\">meetup.com Pro Account</a> would help them grow and nurture their groups. I would also like to encourage the formation of new R user groups. </div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">My second motivation is to help spread the word about the <a href=\"https://www.r-consortium.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-consortium.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241660504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mGx3dpo1aGy5pd2osNzkB\">mission of the R Consortium</a> to support the R Community by promoting the R Language in business and industry, and financing <a href=\"https://www.r-consortium.org/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.r-consortium.org/projects&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241660504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Vw2oIXI98oqlCnNZlpsx5\">projects</a> that provide benefits to significant numbers of R users.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">I will be attending the <a href=\"https://user2018.r-project.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://user2018.r-project.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241660504000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZsHLowoHBSKsDrI6v-Kgc\">useR! 2018 Conference</a> in Australia this summer and I am considering visiting Japan as part of that trip.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Best regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Joseph</div><div><br></div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Joseph B. Rickert <div>RStudio R Community Ambassador</div><div>R Consortium Director</div><div>San Jose, CA</div><div>Cell: <a href=\"tel:(408)%20489-0566\" value=\"+14084890566\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">408.489.0566</a></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
